it was a trending topic,

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.265
[ Cheering and applause ]
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.332
[ Whistling ]
I appreciate that.

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:34.834
It's always so much fun.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.469
